            text: "Weslo was a budget brand of ICON Health & Fitness, which renamed itself iFIT Health & Fitness in 2021. The same company owns NordicTrack and ProForm. That is the most useful fact for an owner: the manufacturer is large, still trading, and still building treadmills on related lines, so parts and cross-references genuinely exist.",
